platforms, and simple structures that invite climbing and exploration. The grassy terrain, surrounded by high walls, creates a cozy and contained world that feels safe and inviting.\n\nThe game emphasizes a laid-back experience, with no rush or high-stakes objectives. Instead, players can enjoy the freedom to roam, experiment with their surroundings, and take in the minimalist, retro-style graphics. Whether you're hopping between platforms, discovering little details, or just soaking up the calm atmosphere, Mandrills VR is the perfect escape for those looking to unwind in a virtual playground.", "short_description": "Mandrills VR is a relaxing and casual game where players explore a cozy, enclosed forest environment. With simple, stylized graphics and interactive elements like wooden platforms and tree stumps, it\u2019s a perfect space for unwinding, climbing, and playful exploration. The focus is on creating a chill and laid-back experience."}]}, "developer_name": "mmo0n", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/privacypolicymandrills/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "mmo0n", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/mandrillsvr/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "28016346821345620"}}]}, "scheduled_offers"